        "emailType": "html",
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Webhook — New Client').first().json.email }}",
        "subject": "=Welcome aboard, {{ $('Webhook — New Client').first().json.name }}! 🎉",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $('Webhook — New Client').first().json.name }},<br><br>Welcome! Here's what happens next:<br><br>1. We've set up your project workspace — a Notion project page, a shared Drive folder, and a dedicated Slack channel.<br>2. Your kickoff call is scheduled — you'll receive a calendar invite shortly.<br>3. Reply to this email any time with questions.<br><br>Looking forward to working with you!<br><br>— The team",
